<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 23-0 V NATAL (335) AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 23-0 V NATAL (335) AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 23 for no wicket in</p>
<p>reply to Natal's first innings score of 335, at the close on the</p>
<p>opening day of their four-day match at Kingsmead on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 335; Australia 23-0.</p>
</text>
